au14-pit-build-verb = Build
au14-pit-build-expand = Expand
au14-pit-build-rope = Add rope
au14-pit-rope-remove = Remove rope
au14-pit-build-rope-from-below = You throw the rope up through the pit above.
au14-pit-build-hatch = Build hatch
au14-pit-build-ladder = Build ladder
au14-pit-build-steps = Build steps
au14-pit-build-failed = You can't build here.
au14-pit-build-started = Construction begins...
au14-pit-build-need-rope = You need a coil of rope in your active hand.
au14-pit-build-need-metal = You need at least { $amount } RMC metal in your active hand.
au14-hatch-open = Open
au14-hatch-close = Close
au14-hatch-pushed-open = You push the hatch open from below.
au14-hatch-camouflage-on = Add camouflage plating
au14-hatch-camouflage-off = Remove camouflage plating
au14-hatch-camouflage-working = You start fitting camouflage plating...
au14-pit-build-need-dig-tool = You need the right digging tool in your active hand for this depth.
au14-pit-tool-wrong-tool = This tool can't dig at this depth.
au14-pit-tool-dig-started = You start digging a pit...
au14-pit-tool-no-tile = There's no ground there to dig into.
au14-pit-tool-tile-occupied = Something's already there.
au14-pit-tool-fill-started = You start filling it in...
au14-pit-tool-mode-up = Switch to digging up
au14-pit-tool-mode-down = Switch to digging down
au14-pit-tool-mode-set-up = You'll dig up into the ceiling now.
au14-pit-tool-mode-set-down = You'll dig down into the floor now.
au14-pit-tool-too-shallow = You're already at the surface, there's nowhere up to dig.
au14-pit-tool-nothing-above = There's nothing above to dig into.
au14-pit-tool-tile-blocked = You can't dig here.
au14-pit-tool-in-vehicle = You can't dig inside a vehicle.
au14-pit-tool-wall-below = There is a wall under there that cannot be dug through: a pit cannot be dug down here.
au14-pit-tool-wall-above = There is a wall over there that cannot be dug through: a pit cannot be dug up here.
au14-pit-tool-needs-jackhammer = Only a jackhammer can drill down into that rock.

au14-ladder-dismantle = Take the ladder and hatch down (30 s)
au14-ladder-dismantle-started = You begin to take the ladder down...
au14-ladder-dismantle-done = The ladder is down and the pit is open. The metal is given back: { $amount }.
